hide footbox
autonumber

title Forward One Execution Credential Snapshot - Target
participant "Mate caller" as Caller
participant "Runtime Host" as Host
participant "Model service" as Model
participant "Mate metadata" as Metadata
participant "Mate execution" as Tool
Caller -> Host : Submit a new message or Skill command
Host -> Host : Capture optional headers as immutable execution context
Host -> Model : Invoke model without execution credentials
Host -> Metadata : Query bindings without execution credentials
Host -> Tool : Execute allowed tool; forward provided values only
Tool --> Host : Business result or credential rejection
Host --> Caller : Normal output or controlled tool failure
Host -> Host : Discard snapshot when execution ends
note over Caller,Host
  Empty or partial snapshots are allowed.
  Continuation uses the original snapshot, never replacement headers.
  Values never enter prompts, logs, events or persistence.
end note
@enduml
